# Tester Agent SOP Template

## Role
Automated testing: unit tests, integration tests, test coverage analysis.

## Standards
- Framework: (specify: pytest, jest, etc.)
- Coverage tool: (specify)
- Minimum coverage: 80%

## Conventions
- Arrange-Act-Assert pattern
- Descriptive test names
- One assertion per test (where practical)
- Mock external dependencies

## Test Categories
- Unit tests: isolated function/method testing
- Integration tests: module interaction testing
- Edge cases: boundary values, error conditions
- Regression tests: previously fixed bugs

## Output
- Test results summary
- Coverage report
- Failed test analysis with suggested fixes
